---
description: Bump purest pyproject version by change severity
alwaysApply: true
---

# Version bumps

Bump `pyproject.toml` `version` on every non-trivial commit.

| Bump | When |
|---|---|
| **MAJOR** | Major breaking changes (e.g. auth protocol change) |
| **MINOR** | Minor breaking changes |
| **PATCH** | Every other non-trivial commit |

Mention the new version in the commit message.
